Project Caribbean
=================

The code in this repository is MIT licensed (see LICENSE). This file lists
third-party assets shipped in the repository, their sources and licences.

Sounds
------

Every sound is CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
Files were converted to mono OGG Vorbis; other changes are noted per file.
Credit is not required by CC0 and is given here with thanks.

